WEBVTT

00:00:11.178 --> 00:00:13.639
Renewal season...

00:00:13.639 --> 00:00:16.475
Do you think we'll survive...?

00:00:18.227 --> 00:00:20.646
There's nothing to worry about.

00:00:20.646 --> 00:00:23.190
Our ratings average 3%.

00:00:23.190 --> 00:00:26.735
That's great for a late-night show.

00:00:27.778 --> 00:00:29.905
Is that true?

00:00:29.905 --> 00:00:31.073
No idea.

00:00:31.073 --> 00:00:32.741
As long as our ratings don't plummet

00:00:32.741 --> 00:00:36.703
and we have a sponsor,
there shouldn't be a problem...

00:00:37.329 --> 00:00:37.913
"Sender: Demon Boss"

00:00:37.913 --> 00:00:42.459
"Sender: Demon Boss"
"The ratings for the last episode
were 0%, so we need to talk.

00:00:42.459 --> 00:00:46.046
Bring everyone at Mouse House to the office."

00:00:46.046 --> 00:00:47.130
What?!

00:00:48.632 --> 00:00:52.052
What?!

00:02:31.777 --> 00:02:33.820
"Look at Us!"

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:35.489
"Look at Us!"
Look at Us!

00:02:35.489 --> 00:02:37.032
"Look at Us!"

00:02:38.867 --> 00:02:40.786
Bunkyo, Tokyo.

00:02:40.786 --> 00:02:44.831
A town of culture, home of Tokyo University
and many companies in the creative field.

00:02:47.125 --> 00:02:48.335
Behold!

00:02:48.335 --> 00:02:51.255
This is Rat Productions,
the Temple of Entertainment!

00:02:53.048 --> 00:02:55.008
It's a cute building.

00:02:55.008 --> 00:02:56.677
I always wonder...

00:02:56.677 --> 00:02:59.263
What exactly do they mean by "temple"?

00:02:59.263 --> 00:03:01.557
Why don't we look it up?

00:03:01.557 --> 00:03:02.558
"Temple."

00:03:02.558 --> 00:03:07.187
"A building or facility that serves
as a central function for a particular field."

00:03:07.187 --> 00:03:08.564
"Central"?

00:03:08.564 --> 00:03:10.315
That's right.

00:03:10.315 --> 00:03:12.025
With an impressive history, too!

00:03:12.025 --> 00:03:14.319
It's been a while since I've been at the office!

00:03:14.319 --> 00:03:17.948
Yeah, we don't come out here too often.

00:03:17.948 --> 00:03:20.742
But the fact all of us were called in...

00:03:20.742 --> 00:03:23.453
Maybe they're really cutting our show...

00:03:23.453 --> 00:03:24.413
What?!

00:03:24.413 --> 00:03:28.041
Does that mean we'll be
kicked out of Mouse House?!

00:03:28.041 --> 00:03:30.002
Are we going to be homeless?!

00:03:31.378 --> 00:03:33.130
Homeless idols...?

00:03:33.130 --> 00:03:35.299
Could it be the next thing?

00:03:35.299 --> 00:03:37.009
That's ridiculous!

00:03:37.009 --> 00:03:40.554
Relax. There's no need to be that worried.

00:03:40.554 --> 00:03:42.598
It's most likely not about that.

00:03:42.598 --> 00:03:44.224
Are you sure?

00:03:44.224 --> 00:03:48.854
A 0% rating isn't that surprising
for late-night shows.

00:03:48.854 --> 00:03:51.899
Shows would be cut all the time
if that were the case.

00:03:51.899 --> 00:03:53.275
Really?

00:03:53.275 --> 00:03:56.695
But it still means that we're not that popular.

00:03:57.571 --> 00:03:59.156
I-It's okay.

00:03:59.156 --> 00:04:03.327
As a last resort, we've got the
"Live! Heart Throb Mouse House" segment!

00:04:04.494 --> 00:04:06.955
Oh no!

00:04:06.955 --> 00:04:08.832
"Oh no"?

00:04:10.709 --> 00:04:12.878
Ladies of Fruit Tart!

00:04:12.878 --> 00:04:15.172
I got tired of waiting for you all!

00:04:15.297 --> 00:04:16.381
"Throb!"

00:04:17.257 --> 00:04:19.801
Why is there an elementary school student here?

00:04:19.801 --> 00:04:21.094
Hey, you two...

00:04:21.094 --> 00:04:21.595
"Roaring..."
Hey, you two...

00:04:21.595 --> 00:04:22.596
"Roaring..."
What the?!

00:04:23.805 --> 00:04:25.432
Um... You listening?

00:04:25.432 --> 00:04:29.686
Little girl, want to chat with us a little?

00:04:29.686 --> 00:04:31.146
--Ino-<i>sempai</i>!
--Inocchi!
--Nina!

00:04:32.356 --> 00:04:34.149
O-Oh, excuse me.

00:04:34.149 --> 00:04:37.110
I couldn't help it. She looks like
a lost young girl to me...

00:04:37.110 --> 00:04:38.529
Couldn't help it?

00:04:38.529 --> 00:04:42.074
Well, it wouldn't be good if that were true...

00:04:42.074 --> 00:04:43.325
I see...

00:04:43.325 --> 00:04:44.368
Flap!

00:04:45.661 --> 00:04:48.497
Don't fall for the trap!

00:04:48.497 --> 00:04:50.874
The rumors were true.

00:04:50.874 --> 00:04:53.794
An equal match for our Cream Anmitsu.

00:04:53.794 --> 00:04:55.712
But not in a good way.

00:04:55.712 --> 00:04:57.673
What? "Our"?

00:04:57.673 --> 00:05:00.759
Hey! I totally recognize her!

00:05:00.759 --> 00:05:04.763
She's the elementary school student
who bought 300 CDs at the concert!

00:05:04.763 --> 00:05:06.139
Seriously?!

00:05:07.683 --> 00:05:12.521
U-Um... Please don't say that
you'd like to return them...!

00:05:12.521 --> 00:05:14.481
Begging to a child?

00:05:14.481 --> 00:05:18.360
Oh, President, how long are you
going to linger at the entrance?

00:05:18.360 --> 00:05:19.361
What?!

00:05:20.529 --> 00:05:22.656
Why are you here at
Rat Productions of all places?

00:05:22.656 --> 00:05:23.991
And who're you calling "President"?

00:05:23.991 --> 00:05:26.952
Oh? Hoho, I guess you didn't know...

00:05:26.952 --> 00:05:29.580
She's the heir of Cat Productions
who skipped a grade

00:05:29.580 --> 00:05:32.124
and graduated from an American university.

00:05:32.124 --> 00:05:33.500
Ahem!

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:36.211
"Cat Productions"
"Acting President"
"Oto Kogane"
Here's my business card to prove it.

00:05:36.211 --> 00:05:39.464
"Cat Productions"
"Acting President"
"Oto Kogane"
It's still unbelievable...

00:05:39.464 --> 00:05:42.134
And plus, even if you are the heir,

00:05:42.134 --> 00:05:45.596
is it okay for an elementary school student
to be an acting president?

00:05:45.596 --> 00:05:48.765
What? President Oto is 19 years old.

00:05:48.765 --> 00:05:49.683
What?!

00:05:49.683 --> 00:05:52.060
Nineteen? Seriously?!

00:05:52.060 --> 00:05:53.061
What?

00:05:53.061 --> 00:05:56.106
Are you saying a 19-year-old
can't wear a school backpack?

00:05:56.106 --> 00:05:57.566
Do you have a problem with that?

00:05:57.566 --> 00:05:59.985
Cosplay is a legitimate hobby!

00:05:59.985 --> 00:06:01.612
"19 years old" "25 years old"

00:06:02.070 --> 00:06:04.823
Cat Productions... Are they okay?

00:06:04.823 --> 00:06:07.868
So what brings you both here?

00:06:07.868 --> 00:06:09.745
Ah! That's right!

00:06:09.745 --> 00:06:11.580
As it turns out,

00:06:11.580 --> 00:06:15.876
according to Hoho's superior,
the show is canceled, but...

00:06:16.793 --> 00:06:18.712
But don't worry, Hoho.

00:06:18.712 --> 00:06:21.173
That's why we're here today.

00:06:22.299 --> 00:06:26.303
Perhaps Miss Oto will make us her servants?

00:06:26.303 --> 00:06:29.223
Let's have a little more pride in ourselves!

00:06:29.223 --> 00:06:30.349
Listen.

00:06:30.349 --> 00:06:32.976
Low ratings are a real issue.

00:06:32.976 --> 00:06:36.522
But the most crucial reason
is that the sponsor backed out.

00:06:36.522 --> 00:06:40.859
Late-night programs
can't survive without sponsors.

00:06:40.859 --> 00:06:44.238
That's why I arranged a sponsor for you girls.

00:06:44.238 --> 00:06:44.988
What?!

00:06:44.988 --> 00:06:45.197
"Temple of Entertainment"
"Rat Productions"
What?!

00:06:45.197 --> 00:06:47.324
"Temple of Entertainment"
"Rat Productions"
R-Really?

00:06:47.324 --> 00:06:48.408
"Temple of Entertainment"
"Rat Productions"
Of course!

00:06:48.408 --> 00:06:50.160
"Temple of Entertainment"
"Rat Productions"
I can make anything happen!

00:06:50.160 --> 00:06:51.620
"Temple of Entertainment"
"Rat Productions"
I'm a genius, after all.

00:06:51.620 --> 00:06:53.247
Th-Then...

00:06:53.247 --> 00:06:54.831
Here, have at it.

00:06:55.666 --> 00:06:56.667
What?

00:06:56.667 --> 00:06:58.377
Have at what?

00:06:58.377 --> 00:06:59.545
Ahem.

00:06:59.545 --> 00:07:02.631
As you guessed, this comes with
a price, of course.

00:07:02.631 --> 00:07:06.218
We want you to participate in our new project.

00:07:06.218 --> 00:07:07.177
Project?

00:07:07.177 --> 00:07:12.224
Yup! A super large-scale project
hosted by Cat Productions!

00:07:12.224 --> 00:07:14.393
A super large-scale project?!

00:07:14.393 --> 00:07:14.726
"Temple of Entertainment"
"Rat Productions"
A super large-scale project?!

00:07:14.726 --> 00:07:17.729
"Temple of Entertainment"
"Rat Productions"
We already got approval from Rat Productions.

00:07:17.729 --> 00:07:20.649
"Temple of Entertainment"
"Rat Productions"
And this is also what your sponsor wants, too.

00:07:20.649 --> 00:07:26.071
The sponsor said, "Please put
my precious girl on TV more often."

00:07:26.071 --> 00:07:27.447
So we don't have a choice!

00:07:27.447 --> 00:07:29.241
Who's the "precious girl"?

00:07:29.241 --> 00:07:31.660
Right, Hayu Nukui?

00:07:31.660 --> 00:07:34.872
What? The "precious girl" is me?

00:07:36.123 --> 00:07:38.125
We have a sponsor because of you!

00:07:38.125 --> 00:07:39.668
That's amazing, Hayu!

00:07:39.668 --> 00:07:41.461
O-Okay...

00:07:41.461 --> 00:07:45.632
I'll... do anything for Fruit Tart...!

00:07:45.632 --> 00:07:47.509
You're so cute, Hayu!

00:07:47.509 --> 00:07:51.388
Hey! I'm not giving you my backpack!

00:07:51.388 --> 00:07:55.142
Seriously, is Cat Productions okay...?

00:07:55.142 --> 00:07:58.312
Now, why don't we go meet the sponsor, then?

00:07:58.312 --> 00:08:00.272
The sponsor's here?!

00:08:00.272 --> 00:08:01.273
Of course!

00:08:01.273 --> 00:08:04.526
I thought you'd all feel
more comfortable if you met them...

00:08:04.526 --> 00:08:06.695
I'll do anything for Fruit Tart!

00:08:06.695 --> 00:08:07.946
What are you doing?

00:08:07.946 --> 00:08:11.575
It's common practice to
entertain the important people.

00:08:11.575 --> 00:08:13.243
Master...?

00:08:13.243 --> 00:08:15.913
It's shameless and I question your morals!

00:08:15.913 --> 00:08:19.791
We have no idea how to "entertain"...

00:08:19.791 --> 00:08:22.211
Have you done it before, Roko-<i>sempai</i>?

00:08:22.211 --> 00:08:23.253
Me?

00:08:23.253 --> 00:08:25.464
Well, I guess you could say that.

00:08:25.464 --> 00:08:28.467
But that was when I was little.

00:08:28.467 --> 00:08:30.177
Besides, adults are easy to please.

00:08:30.177 --> 00:08:32.346
I just acted like a goody-two-shoes.

00:08:32.346 --> 00:08:34.890
I will do my very best!

00:08:34.890 --> 00:08:37.017
Oh, how admirable!

00:08:37.017 --> 00:08:39.978
Shameless and immoral, after all!

00:08:39.978 --> 00:08:43.899
Then should I do the same thing as you, Roko?

00:08:43.899 --> 00:08:46.026
I don't know about you, Hayu.

00:08:46.026 --> 00:08:49.446
You're cute, but lack a little character...

00:08:49.446 --> 00:08:53.742
I think your fans like
the girly side of you, Hayu.

00:08:53.742 --> 00:08:55.536
If you can really bring that out...

00:08:55.536 --> 00:08:57.412
G-Girly?!

00:08:57.412 --> 00:09:00.874
I was going for the "cool idol" image!

00:09:00.874 --> 00:09:02.626
I like rock music, too...

00:09:02.626 --> 00:09:04.962
It's not very convincing
when you're in that outfit...

00:09:04.962 --> 00:09:05.671
"Temple of Entertainment"
"Rat Productions"

00:09:05.671 --> 00:09:08.257
"Temple of Entertainment"
"Rat Productions"
You've got nothing to worry about, Hayu.

00:09:08.257 --> 00:09:09.424
"Temple of Entertainment"
"Rat Productions"
That's right.

00:09:09.424 --> 00:09:12.469
"Temple of Entertainment"
"Rat Productions"
The sponsor is a very gentle person.

00:09:12.469 --> 00:09:16.640
They'll accept you, Hayu, no matter how you are.

00:09:16.640 --> 00:09:19.518
That's right, just like a mother.

00:09:19.518 --> 00:09:22.813
A mother? How could that be?

00:09:23.730 --> 00:09:25.023
Could it be...?

00:09:33.240 --> 00:09:34.366
I'm Rua Nakamachi!

00:09:34.366 --> 00:09:36.618
A second year in high school,
born on January 1st.

00:09:36.618 --> 00:09:40.664
Blood type is AB, I'm 146 cm, and I weigh 36 kg.

00:09:40.664 --> 00:09:43.083
My favorite thing is Nua!

00:09:50.507 --> 00:09:52.593
<i>Dropout Idol Fruit Tart</i>!

00:09:53.927 --> 00:09:55.888
Hey there! It's been a while!

00:09:55.888 --> 00:09:57.598
How is my Hayu doing?

00:09:57.598 --> 00:09:59.224
M-Mom?!

00:09:59.224 --> 00:10:00.601
Why are you here?!

00:10:00.601 --> 00:10:01.768
Mom?!

00:10:01.768 --> 00:10:03.812
Jeez! What a meanie!

00:10:03.812 --> 00:10:05.606
I'm only here to support your dream, Hayu,

00:10:05.606 --> 00:10:08.692
that's why I became a sponsor!

00:10:08.692 --> 00:10:10.194
M-My dream?

00:10:10.194 --> 00:10:12.196
That's right. To make lots of money

00:10:12.196 --> 00:10:14.198
and buy lots of adult panties
that you love so much!

00:10:14.198 --> 00:10:15.991
"Hayu 5 years old"
and buy lots of adult panties
that you love so much!

00:10:15.991 --> 00:10:17.242
"Hayu 5 years old"

00:10:17.242 --> 00:10:19.912
"Hayu 5 years old"
One day, I'll have lots of them, too!

00:10:19.912 --> 00:10:20.996
I understand.

00:10:20.996 --> 00:10:23.165
That's not it at all, dummy!

00:10:23.165 --> 00:10:24.041
Oh?

00:10:24.041 --> 00:10:27.753
Isn't the show supposed to be a little sexy?

00:10:27.753 --> 00:10:31.173
You're... not wrong, but no!

00:10:31.173 --> 00:10:33.675
It's your typical idol show...

00:10:33.675 --> 00:10:35.093
It's not sexy...

00:10:35.093 --> 00:10:38.305
It's a pleasure to meet you all! I'm Hayo Nukui.

00:10:38.305 --> 00:10:42.059
Thank you for taking care of my daughter!

00:10:42.059 --> 00:10:43.894
Are you listening to me?!

00:10:43.894 --> 00:10:45.896
Oh, please.

00:10:45.896 --> 00:10:48.315
Greetings are a common courtesy.

00:10:48.315 --> 00:10:50.734
You're still such a baby, aren't you?

00:10:50.734 --> 00:10:52.277
That's enough, Mom!

00:10:52.277 --> 00:10:54.780
I'm an adult too now!

00:10:54.780 --> 00:10:56.573
Oh, Hayu...

00:10:56.573 --> 00:10:57.699
You're right.

00:10:57.699 --> 00:11:01.036
The ones you wore at the concert
were adult panties.

00:11:01.036 --> 00:11:03.163
How do you know?!

00:11:03.163 --> 00:11:05.374
Well of course I know!

00:11:05.374 --> 00:11:09.878
I've always been watching over you,
even after you were disowned by your dad.

00:11:10.754 --> 00:11:14.049
What?! That's pretty serious, Hayu!

00:11:14.049 --> 00:11:15.259
It's true.

00:11:15.259 --> 00:11:19.263
She left the house because she wanted
to pursue music no matter what.

00:11:19.263 --> 00:11:21.640
You don't get it, Dad!

00:11:21.640 --> 00:11:23.517
Well, she didn't leave that time

00:11:23.517 --> 00:11:26.186
since she couldn't find her way out of the yard.

00:11:27.479 --> 00:11:29.439
How do I get out?!

00:11:29.439 --> 00:11:30.732
So cute!

00:11:30.732 --> 00:11:32.067
How big is their yard?

00:11:32.067 --> 00:11:34.695
But Dad got really mad,

00:11:34.695 --> 00:11:37.948
so he gave her up to Mouse House.

00:11:38.740 --> 00:11:40.617
It's all Dad's fault!

00:11:40.617 --> 00:11:43.203
I still haven't forgiven him, you know?

00:11:43.203 --> 00:11:44.621
Hayu...

00:11:47.666 --> 00:11:50.961
I knew it. As usual,
you're wearing kiddie panties.

00:11:50.961 --> 00:11:53.297
Do you want me to run away again?!

00:11:54.715 --> 00:11:55.924
I see.

00:11:55.924 --> 00:12:00.220
Basically, this all stems from a family quarrel.

00:12:00.220 --> 00:12:05.809
Since her father is still mad, you're unable
to provide direct support to Hayu.

00:12:05.809 --> 00:12:08.770
That's why you're using
Cat Productions as a middle-man.

00:12:08.770 --> 00:12:10.647
Yup! That's exactly right!

00:12:10.647 --> 00:12:14.526
Gosh! They're both such babies,
it's driving me nuts!

00:12:15.569 --> 00:12:17.738
Then I've got a suggestion for you.

00:12:17.738 --> 00:12:19.364
Oh? What could it be?

00:12:19.364 --> 00:12:22.034
If we get those two to reconcile,

00:12:22.034 --> 00:12:23.994
will you directly provide aid to Mouse House...?

00:12:23.994 --> 00:12:26.038
Of course, I'd love to!

00:12:26.038 --> 00:12:27.664
What? Hey! Wait!

00:12:28.916 --> 00:12:31.043
Then there's no problem at all!

00:12:31.043 --> 00:12:33.629
President Oto, we'll gladly accept the offer

00:12:33.629 --> 00:12:36.215
for your super large-scale project!

00:12:36.215 --> 00:12:37.382
Listen, everyone!

00:12:37.382 --> 00:12:40.719
We can win as long as we work hard
to be accepted by Hayu's father!

00:12:40.719 --> 00:12:42.513
We need to defeat Cat Productions!

00:12:42.513 --> 00:12:43.347
Whoa!

00:12:43.347 --> 00:12:44.306
That's bold!

00:12:44.306 --> 00:12:46.600
Hoho... You're so cool!

00:12:46.600 --> 00:12:48.560
Darn you...

00:12:48.560 --> 00:12:50.812
Fine then, Fruit Tart.

00:12:50.812 --> 00:12:52.648
But you better brace yourselves.

00:12:52.648 --> 00:12:56.777
"National Idol Championships!"
"Proposal"
This super large-scale project
shouldn't be taken lightly!

00:13:00.322 --> 00:13:02.950
"National Idol
Championships!"

00:13:09.039 --> 00:13:11.792
Your love can save an idol?

00:13:11.792 --> 00:13:14.253
What does that mean?

00:13:14.253 --> 00:13:16.171
It's linked with reality!

00:13:16.171 --> 00:13:18.298
A new type of game!

00:13:18.298 --> 00:13:20.384
We need to win and aim for

00:13:20.384 --> 00:13:22.177
the National Idol Championships!

00:13:24.012 --> 00:13:24.429
"National Idol
Championships!"

00:13:24.429 --> 00:13:25.722
"National Idol
Championships!"
NIC, for short!

00:13:25.722 --> 00:13:28.267
"National Idol
Championships!"
Available to play now!

00:13:28.267 --> 00:13:30.102
"National Idol
Championships!"
Show us all your love!

00:13:34.273 --> 00:13:36.441
What the heck is this...?

00:13:36.441 --> 00:13:40.487
Anyway, I can't believe
they launched a social game.

00:13:40.487 --> 00:13:43.115
It's really been launched already.

00:13:43.115 --> 00:13:46.076
By "love" they mean "money," right?

00:13:46.076 --> 00:13:46.326
Was that what they were saying?

00:13:46.326 --> 00:13:49.037
"Dollar"
"Yen"
Was that what they were saying?

00:13:49.037 --> 00:13:51.707
Who would ever fall for this?

00:13:54.668 --> 00:13:57.171
"Idol Gacha 10 consecutive rolls"
"3000 yen"

00:13:57.671 --> 00:13:59.339
You're not clicking that!

00:13:59.339 --> 00:14:02.551
Don't get lured into this!
You're all part of the game!

00:14:02.551 --> 00:14:05.012
But! I want the rare Roko-<i>sempai</i>!

00:14:05.012 --> 00:14:06.972
--And Inocchi!
--And Ino-<i>sempai</i>!

00:14:06.972 --> 00:14:08.056
Rare?

00:14:08.056 --> 00:14:09.391
